# Trust: Halver (hidden quest TrustHalver): a level 99 Warrior in the Chateau d'Oraguille. Halver (his script
# npcs/Halver.lua; default text HALVER_OFFSET + 1092). RoV The Path Untraveled completed (setup). No permit: the check
# fails: his script. The San d'Oria Trust Permit (a GM): every talk gives the cipher (the stopgap) and plays noAction.
# With a full inventory the giveItem fails (its message, no cipher). The cipher held: the check fails: his script.
lists ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger
char zone=ChateauDoraguille pos=2.4,0,3.4 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Rov ThePathUntraveled completed
login
trigger Halver                          # no permit: the check fails: his script
finish-if-event
keyitem SanDoriaTrustPermit             # a GM
fill-inventory
trigger Halver                          # no room: giveItem fails; noAction
free-inventory
trigger Halver                          # the cipher; noAction
trigger Halver                          # the cipher held: the check fails: his script
finish-if-event
